# システム環境設定's 写しを作る of 〈書体〉 (docs/tessronos 11.6): the system's face, a link of the
# machine's settings as the wallpaper is, carried by a link of the copy's record 0. The copy made and
# opened: the face it names is the one set now, nothing differs, and 取り消し sets nothing. For
# tools/ui_run.py as ui_sysenv_page.steps; the menu's 写しを作る the third line of 操作.
openapp 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42 {"tessronos-sysenv":{"data":"font"}}
expect sysenv: page "font"
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
click 400 300 1
wait 500
move 405 341
wait 150
move 440 341
wait 150
move 470 341
wait 300
move 495 375
wait 150
click 495 375
expect sysenv: copy of "font" made, 1 lines (0)
expect desktop: link put "システム環境設定（書体）の写し"
wait 800
logmark
openput
expectsince sysenv: copy of "font" opened, 1 lines, 0 differ, 0 left out
wait 800
shot sfc_ask
click 650 452
expectsince sysenv: copy of "font" put back
absent sysenv: system face
absent !OACV!
